	<ouc:div label="main-content" group="Everyone" button-text="Main Content"><ouc:editor csspath="/_resources/ou/editor/wysiwyg.css" cssmenu="/_resources/ou/editor/styles.txt" wysiwyg-class="main-content"/><p><img style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/arts-languages-humanities-white-back.jpg" alt="Arts, Language, Humanities Icon" width="285" height="302" /></p>
<p><span>Discover the full human experience through oral communication, writing, and creative expression. Fine-tune your problem-solving and critical-thinking skills while nourishing your artistic side. Explore careers in education, performing and studio arts, journalism, or language and communications.</span>&nbsp;</p>
